    "description": "India headline All-India CPI (Combined) monthly time series. Each row carries the index level (FRED OECD mirror base 2010=100) and the headline YoY% inflation as published by MoSPI. Used by the macro agent for the inflation regime signal.",
    "source_authority": "MoSPI monthly CPI press release on the 12th of the following month (mospi.gov.in). Mirrored by FRED INDCPIALLMINMEI (OECD-sourced, monthly index level back to 1957). The MoSPI native PDFs and FRED CSV are both free; FRED requires a free API key for the JSON API but the CSV download URL works without auth.",
    "format_notes": [
      "period is the DATA month in YYYY-MM (April 2025 -> '2025-04'), not the release month.",
      "cpi_index is on the FRED 2010=100 base; YoY% is invariant to base choice.",
      "yoy_pct is the headline number that drives RBI MPC decisions and bond-market real-rate expectations."
    ],
    "last_updated": "2026-05-26",
    "row_count_target": "Backfill from 2014-01 (post-2012 CPI series start) to 2025-04 (latest as of seed creation)."
